  "htmlContent": "<p>因為雲端虛擬機不會包含本機的 <code>.env</code> 檔案，所以必須將金鑰存放在 GitHub 儲存庫的 <strong>Secrets</strong> 裡面供腳本讀取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-1.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>需要以下兩個金鑰，點上圖綠色新增即可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_API_KEY</strong></code></li>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_DATABASE_ID</strong></code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/31682f85-b904-4805-902e-18126780c624/3a3210e3-1b45-4e6f-9c69-03f97fe5894c/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466VQILO3SA%2F20261126%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20261126T073530Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEO3%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQCSfl76FE0%2FLbsJCG6yGAuKyZckXGOsWO5WU9xksoxX7gIhAIRXxQxuOL46XlERbWmjt6g8cJoh9gUsohxa0MipmPCUKogECLX%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEQABoMNjM3NDIzMTgzODA1IgyGuf5Iyz3ROdI3hO8q3AO3AwSp47GIgpP3zcDW5TW1FkoDOyCL2srk0rOEklXa8BA9x8LMKOiU%2BrARt0c9XX3za7uH3Tdx%2BMusQ%2F4Od0c4lTun5eFmbguyEQhnXGuoFziIfxssRaUINPBl0B5bK%2FPzqd8OjauePyvFwxXfX89wNewf2EUTSKgzdNep1yTZViR60UJdobgMNZnP975%2FuMyiqnZatnqUdR%2FXLqDjL6rt5Mp8%2F7H2XfKvJnhjLgcAAufKsXriynKZmR0FlhIFv9VuP4n7S9VxQRLM2za36TzYYRjYbTNimmt3Gt0UFjQdfbzWs2wIXxhHRyNqNAxiCncnULk8XCTFW76BKJz9soXrC8uyQmLwERFv6GUjpg8Zz7PaJBRt%2F9eBdRimO7n9N2T8QjokmX1h9DvbyUKG3NJNRcN5o%2FCWz2ufbRTSSInY9YR%2Bjh10YYnTFLZ07VOO6mv0RaqTS6HgEykDzTAUyFkuRJs2lltKtwP3dSsWLObgjgKB%2F%2BgDlrYCYG7XrNJY4M4bdqH%2BqgUmpCzVRqd%2BLSRwGy66%2FnFE0H33qmItwsj%2FqH8pTinlxt0P1qiRBwgKoc2FZG9LEdK9sYzYI4MwV6dJmnI37CkKpaw2mamMmNo%2BSvi4G0ZgSMs3exPnkDDy8p7YBjqkAfDVkV4jMWcSokOocjgq%2BUekGqVNLFngiW8XrNIHKEYmKckWNBOa0Sd6tSy8PuhVuMeYhJ9pGF%2BsfxsGBPY8quK0ApteFX41qrafAAeJyQabDKX%2Bv21HxzH812xf9vy9NI7TUQaWroReSF0BQQAamcE1MIZXFGwu4q3sLvw8TxJOA3uUxSE%2F2F5g22Btyj21Dj%2FyHOuboNXvWpYgtEQRjulBWT2X&amp;X-Amz-Signature=b621168a7be0eba75865d5669baae2f0dc6f9093c184ea3523c22f389b